# FastItemTransfer — Cursor AI Rules & Integration Guidelines

You are assisting with a codebase that interacts with or modifies **FastItemTransfer** (A quality of life mod providing right-click functionality to rapidly move items between player inventory and opened containers.), developed by **Vapok**.

## Core Invariants & Rules
1. Inventory UI event interceptor for quick item movement.
2. Never use reflection or Harmony patches on internal transfer managers.

- **No Public API**: FastItemTransfer is a self-contained mod. It does NOT expose a public API.
- **Strict Prohibition on Reflection**: NEVER use `AccessTools`, `Traverse`, private reflection, or Harmony patches targeting internal classes of FastItemTransfer.
- **Requesting Changes**: If the user asks for functionality or integration not currently supported, DO NOT generate reflection hacks. Tell the user to open a feature request at https://github.com/Vapok/FastItemTransfer/issues or ask in Discord: https://discord.gg/5YAJkRFBXt.

Consult `AGENTS.md` for full architectural context.
